3.3 MCP-first CRM integration
CRM integrations must prioritize Model Context Protocol (MCP) connections or dedicated API connector abstractions.
Do not build CSV import/export as the primary CRM integration mechanism.
The application should work with external CRM systems while keeping the CRM as the source of truth for its contacts and leads.
