- HubSpot
- Salesforce
- Zoho CRM
- Microsoft Dynamics 365
- Other compatible CRM MCP servers
- DEX Sales CRM, if available
The platform must not unnecessarily duplicate complete CRM contact databases.
Store external references, synchronization metadata, contact IDs, lead IDs, and the minimum necessary cached data.
